  "title": "Honey Grilled Shrimp",
  "description": "Easy and delicious honey grilled shrimp! Onions, peppers, and mushrooms are perfect when alternated with shrimp on the skewers. Just cut into bite-sized pieces and add them to the marinade with the shrimp.",
